          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "INkosi yathi kimi: Hamba futhi, uthande owesifazana othandwa yisithandwa sakhe loyisifebe, njengoba iNkosi ithanda abakoIsrayeli, lanxa bephendukela kwabanye onkulunkulu, bethanda izinkwa zezithelo ezomisiweyo zevini ezinikelwa ezithombeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengimthenga ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " esiliva alitshumi lanhlanu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " elilengxenye ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngathi kuye: Uzahlala lami ube ngowami insuku ezinengi; ungawuli, ungabi ngowenye indoda, lami ngizakuba ngowakho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngoba abakoIsrayeli bazahlala insuku ezinengi bengelankosi lombusi, lomhlatshelo, lensika yokukhonzela, bengelangubo yamahlombe, lezithombe ezithiwa ngamaterafi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emva kwalokho abakoIsrayeli bazabuya bayidinge iNkosi uNkulunkulu wabo, loDavida inkosi yabo. Bazabuya eNkosini besesaba, beze lasekulungeni kwayo ensukwini ezizayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
